  <LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofed>無法在屋頂下運作</LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofed>
  <!-- EN: Like the {0}, it can't be placed or operated under a roof. Turn off to allow. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofedDesc>如同{0}，它無法在屋頂下放置或操作。關閉後即可允許。</LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofedDesc>
