  <!-- EN: Weight of the uninstalled scanner when hauled or carried by a caravan. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_MassDesc>移除安裝後的掃描器，由搬運或旅隊攜帶時的質量。</LocalMineralScanner_MassDesc>

